msgid "GraphDisplay"
msgstr ""

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:1
msgid "Classe contenant les paramètres de Visualization :"
msgstr "Class containing visualization settings:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:3
msgid "Attributs :"
msgstr "Attributes:"

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:4
msgid "**Limits** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Limite les données à ±3σ autour de la moyenne (règle des 3 sigmas)."
msgstr "**Limits** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Limits the data to ±3σ around the mean (3-sigma rule)."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:5
msgid "**Sigma** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Trace des lignes pointillées à des distances de 1, 2 et 3 sigmas de la moyenne."
msgstr "**Sigma** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox. CheckBox>`): Plots dashed lines at distances of 1, 2, and 3 sigmas from the mean."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:7
msgid "**Gauss** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Affiche la courbe gaussienne associée à la moyenne et à l'écart-type des données. ."
msgstr "**Gauss** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Displays the Gaussian curve associated with the mean and standard deviation of the data."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:9
msgid "**KDE** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Affiche l'estimation de densité par noyau (la courbe la plus proche de l'histogramme) associée aux données."
msgstr "**KDE** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Displays the kernel density estimate (the curve closest to the histogram) associated with the data."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:11
msgid "**Cumul** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Affiche un histogramme cumulatif à la place d'un histogramme simple."
msgstr "**Cumul** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Displays a cumulative histogram instead of a simple histogram."

#: of palm_tracer.Settings.Groups.GraphDisplay.GraphDisplay:12
msgid "**Log Scale** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`) : Applique une échelle logarithmique aux données."
msgstr "**Log Scale** (:class:`CheckBox <palm_tracer.Settings.Types.CheckBox.CheckBox>`): Applies a logarithmic scale to the data."

